{"file":"dataink-3.3.0-v1.zip","bytes":76232,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"dataink","description":"AI skills for effective data communication — visualization, storytelling, infographic design, dashboard layout, table design, and visualization review based on Tufte, Few, and Knaflic methodologies","version":"3.3.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/oh-da/dataink","homepage":"https://github.com/oh-da/dataink#readme","keywords":["data-visualization","storytelling","infographic","charts","data-communication","dashboard","accessibility","review"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/dashboard-design/SKILL.md","name":"dashboard-design","description":"Designs dashboard layouts with KPI hierarchy, component selection, and attention choreography. Use when creating dashboards, KPI displays, monitoring screens, or executive summary views.","headings":["Dashboard Design","Critical Constraints","Instructions","Step 1: Define Audience and Purpose","Step 2: Identify and Rank KPIs","Step 3: Select Component Types","Step 4: Design Layout with Attention Choreography","Step 5: Apply Branding, Color, and Accessibility","Step 6: Validate — 5-Second Test","Step 7: Generate Output","Troubleshooting"],"name_hint":"看板 · 设计","description_zh":"设计仪表板布局、KPI层次、组件和注意力顺序，用于监控、指标展示及管理摘要。"},{"path":"skills/data-storyteller/SKILL.md","name":"data-storyteller","description":"Structures the narrative arc, flow, and logic of data-driven presentations and reports. Use when building slide decks, structuring executive summaries, outlining reports, framing decisions, or improving narrative flow.","headings":["Data Storytelling Expert","Critical Constraints","Instructions","Step 0: Capture Context","Step 1: Define the Audience and the Tension","Step 2: Construct the Three-Act Narrative Arc","Step 3: Determine Narrative Flow and Repetition","Step 4: Validate the Story","Example"],"name_hint":"数据 · storyteller","description_zh":"组织数据演示与报告的叙事、逻辑和流程，用于幻灯片、管理摘要、报告提纲与决策表达。"},{"path":"skills/data-visualization/SKILL.md","name":"data-visualization","description":"Selects, designs, and refines data visualizations for clarity, accuracy, and accessibility. Use when choosing chart types, improving graphs, reducing clutter, applying brand colors, or designing individual charts.","headings":["Data Visualization Expert","Critical Constraints","Instructions","Step 1: Determine the Medium","Step 2: Choose the Chart Type","Step 3: Maximize the Data-Ink Ratio","Step 4: Apply Branding and Color","Step 5: Focus Attention","Step 6: Accessibility Check","Step 7: Validate","Step 8: Generate Output","Troubleshooting"],"name_hint":"数据 · visualization","description_zh":"选择与改进数据图表，使其清晰、准确和可访问，处理图型、视觉杂乱、品牌颜色及单个图表设计。"},{"path":"skills/infographic-creator/SKILL.md","name":"infographic-creator","description":"Designs the layout, color strategy, and narrative structure of data-driven infographics. Use when creating infographics, visual summaries, one-page data reports, or combining multiple data points into a single visual.","headings":["Infographic Creator","Critical Constraints","Instructions","Step 1: Understand Context and Storyboard","Step 2: Choose Displays and Maximize Data-Ink","Step 3: Apply Branding and Color","Step 4: Focus Attention and Apply Text","Step 5: Accessibility Check","Step 6: Validate","Step 7: Generate Output","Troubleshooting"],"name_hint":"infographic · creator","description_zh":"设计数据驱动信息图的布局、颜色与叙事结构，适用于可视化摘要、单页报告及多个数据点的整合呈现。"},{"path":"skills/table-design/SKILL.md","name":"table-design","description":"Designs clear, readable data tables — structure, alignment, number formatting, grouping, and summary rows. Use when presenting exact values, building reference or lookup tables, formatting tabular reports, or when a chart is the wrong medium.","headings":["Table Design","Critical Constraints","Instructions","Step 1: Confirm the Medium","Step 2: Structure Rows and Columns","Step 3: Format Numbers","Step 4: Align","Step 5: Delineate Lightly","Step 6: Highlight (optional)","Step 7: Accessibility and Output","Troubleshooting"],"name_hint":"表 · 设计","description_zh":"设计清晰易读的数据表，处理结构、对齐、数字格式、分组与汇总行，适用于精确数值、查找表和表格报告。"},{"path":"skills/visualization-review/SKILL.md","name":"visualization-review","description":"Critiques and improves existing data visualizations using a prioritized rule system (P0 accessibility and integrity, P1 clarity, P2 polish). Use when reviewing charts, auditing dashboards, checking accessibility compliance, or identifying anti-patterns.","headings":["Visualization Review","Instructions","Step 1: Receive the Visualization","Step 2: Run P0 → P1 → P2 Checks","Step 3: Generate Report","Step 4: Apply Fixes (if requested)","Example"],"name_hint":"visualization · 评审","description_zh":"按P0可访问性与数据完整性、P1清晰度、P2完善度审查和改进可视化，检查图表、仪表板及常见反模式。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["DataInk","Why DataInk","Getting Started","Install from the marketplace","Install locally for development","Available skills","Customize brand assets","Workflow","Visualizing Data","Creating Infographics","Storytelling with Data","Reviewing Visualizations","Designing Dashboards","Designing Tables","Use Cases","Business reporting","Dashboard and chart design","Data storytelling and presentations","Infographics and visual reports","Visualization audit and improvement","Design Philosophy","Repository Structure","Skill Architecture","Version History","Roadmap","Contributing","License","Acknowledgments and Attribution","Cole Nussbaumer Knaflic — *Storytelling with Data* (Wiley, 2015)","Stephen Few — *Show Me the Numbers* (Perceptual Edge, 2004)"]},{"path":"evals/README.md","headings":["DataInk Evals","Format","Running","When to run"]},{"path":"docs/guides/README.md","headings":["DataInk Beginner Guides · מדריכים למתחילים"]},{"path":"docs/guides/en/README.md","headings":["DataInk Beginner Guides","Which guide do I need?","Before you start","The one idea behind everything"]},{"path":"docs/guides/he/READM